  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds fresh strawberries, hulled and sliced",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 quart heavy cream",
    "1 (6 ounce) container lemon yogurt",
    "1 (3.3 ounce) package instant white chocolate pudding mix",
    "2 tablespoons coconut-flavored rum, or to taste, divided",
    "2 (16 ounce) prepared pound cakes, cubed",
    "2 pints fresh blueberries, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YPWdGvn0Tg5gBmyBnPd422er9xQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-005-step-01-2cf10f98628d4179baa99044ad99351d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218361/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle strawberries with sugar in a bowl; stir to distribute sugar, and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0Vm_J8gXQcyKp8MMHK7zWK0oXh4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-005-step-02-a0eace3981df4a468ddce504b2f2462f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218361/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill a large metal mixing bowl and beaters from an electric mixer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DZSSy_Uihk9CJfiP6LglJHKrKOg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-007-step-03-b69ee39602c044689aa03d9e564b2966.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218361/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cream into the chilled mixing bowl, and add lemon yogurt, pudding mix, and about 1 tablespoon of coconut rum; beat until fluffy with an electric mixer set on medium speed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M6_hGns1T_Y-3yLEaBcpYkreaTs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-008-step-04-6db70db7383a40759f0abe807541bed7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218361/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread a layer of pound cake cubes into the bottom of a glass trifle dish, and sprinkle cubes with remaining tablespoon coconut rum. Cover pound cake with a layer of strawberries; sprinkle blueberries over strawberries. Spread a thick layer of whipped cream over the berries.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GA6BzS82r8Lok_4RmEemq_D8z3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-009-step-05-3685ac274815411eb143612b11645fff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218361/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat the layers several times, ending with a layer of strawberries sprinkled with blueberries and reserving about 1 cup of whipped cream; top the trifle with dollops of whipped cream to serve. Refrigerate leftovers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/97Y1a_62ph5-_ZKzocUNM6I65Yk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218361-all-american-trifle-VAT-010-step-06-be3b0ad3c85a49d0b476d4e746f58632.jpg"
      ],
